    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Galaxy_at_War\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy at War\">Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy at War</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You cause so much devastation to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Vehicles\" title=\"Vehicles\">Vehicles</a> and objects that you also deal damage to others around those targets.</p><p><b>Effect:</b> When you deal damage to an object or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Vehicle\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Vehicle\">Vehicle</a> that equals or exceeds the target's <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Damage_Threshold\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage Threshold\">Damage Threshold</a> and reduces the target to 0 Hit Points, you deal 1 die of damage (of the same type as the damage used in the attack) to all targets, including allies, that are adjacent to the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Vehicle\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Vehicle\">Vehicle</a> or object.</p>",
